       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose is above the maximum.\n\nIbuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day. The maximum for adults is 3,200 mg/day under physician supervision, and OTC labeling caps it at 1,200 mg/day. A dose this high risks GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nYou may have meant one of these:\n- **400 mg PO four times daily** (1,600 mg/day)\n- **800 mg PO three times daily** (2,400 mg/day), which is a common anti-inflammatory dose\n- **800 mg PO four times daily** (3,200 mg/day), the maximum dose\n- **1600 mg/day** divided another way\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it. If you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm and I'll note the rationale on the order."
